{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11109310","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11109310","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1110931001:0":{"text":"Crimson rocky terrain... Could it be the Crimson Highlands?","source_cn":"赭红的岩地，难道是深红高原吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2B9FDCC3914F958","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110931002:1":{"text":"No way. The Crimson Highlands are home to several large Mauler colonies. The Quicksand Claws wouldn't have built their base there.","source_cn":"不，深红高原在北方，散布着不少大型蛮血聚落，流沙之爪不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x129EDA3A0DBB4BB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110931003:0":{"text":"There's an abandoned trade route to the east of Alkali. The terrain is rugged and dangerous. Robberies took place frequently after the earthquake. Most caravans avoid it altogether.","source_cn":"咸水镇东边有一条废弃的商道，那周围地势险峻，地震后由于...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6934DE9FB4BAFAD5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1110931004:1":{"text":"Remote and less traveled. That sounds about right.","source_cn":"偏僻又没人，听起来像。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3204B545F72083EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1110931005:0":{"text":"Satrana, thanks.","source_cn":"萨忒娜，谢了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59CD5315A83AB90A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110931006:2":{"text":"...No, no! What is that?","source_cn":"……不，不……！那是什么？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC30FE7B61D717FAF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1110931007:0":{"text":"...Satrana?","source_cn":"……萨忒娜？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC35258E1A17FFDE6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1110931008:2":{"text":"A scarlet cloud that can't be seen through... A gigantic black peak... that rises from the red tide...","source_cn":"一片无法窥透的暗红……在红潮中……升起巨大的黑色尖峰……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8EAE04EF16598D7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1110931009:0":{"text":"She's still predicting! But she's already located the Quicksand Claws. I thought the ceremony was over!","source_cn":"她还在预言！明明已经占卜出流沙之爪的所在，仪式应该结束...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57240A251900E972","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1110931010:2":{"text":"Evil is surging in the crimson... The peak tears the sky...","source_cn":"邪恶在深红中涌动……尖峰将刺破苍穹……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B52876B1FD406B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1110931011:0":{"text":"Everything will tumble!","source_cn":"然后，一切将会倾覆！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA98EA134FC165A39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1110931012:1":{"text":"Err... Ahh...","source_cn":"呃……唔……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E9941A9B1238C66","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:21:1110931012":{"text":"Err... Ahh...","source_cn":"呃……唔……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E9941A9B1238C66","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1110931013:0":{"text":"Satrana, you finally woke up!","source_cn":"萨忒娜，你终于醒了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8436600235593C74","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1110931014:0":{"text":"I... I saw something horrible just now.","source_cn":"我……我刚才看见了可怕的景象。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1096C8FAE455197E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1110931015:0":{"text":"Those scenes—the crimson tide and the black peak—were horrifying! Why did I see those?!","source_cn":"那些景象……深红之潮和黑色的尖峰……又压抑又恐怖！为什...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC88FFA73DEF6DDD8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1110931016:0":{"text":"Don't think about it.","source_cn":"不要想了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FD5BAD0F34623BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1110931017:0":{"text":"But the prophecy...","source_cn":"可是，预言里的情形……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4C27920834D91DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1110931018:1":{"text":"That's only a part of it. We don't know the result yet.","source_cn":"你的预言只能展示一些片段，最后不一定是什么结果。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68DCC34074E1DCC8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1110931019:1":{"text":"Perhaps you don't have the full picture, like what happened with the necklace thief.","source_cn":"比如，偷项链的犯人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A98BAEBAA22AC3B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:32:1110931019":{"text":"Perhaps you don't have the full picture, like what happened with the necklace thief.","source_cn":"比如，偷项链的犯人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A98BAEBAA22AC3B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1110931020:0":{"text":"Hopefully...","source_cn":"但愿……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF1D841BC3B41BAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1110931021:0":{"text":"What's your plan? To track down the Quicksand Claws?","source_cn":"你们接下来准备做什么？去找流沙之爪吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2386AC11E44D4114","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1110931022:0":{"text":"Yes, to save my people.","source_cn":"嗯。去救人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD29C17F06E463A62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1110931023:1":{"text":"To settle the score with Ferranc!","source_cn":"去找弗兰克算账！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49D9F6090C510489","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1110931024:0":{"text":"You're going as well?","source_cn":"你也去？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x83B055C757388E64","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1110931025:0":{"text":"Let me make it clear. We have completely different reasons. We just happen to be traveling the same way.","source_cn":"别误会，我们要做的事完全不同。只是恰好同路罢了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA9232A085D182BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1110931026:0":{"text":"I'm going with you!","source_cn":"——我！我也要和你们一起去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x133F129A724F7C42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:42:1110931026":{"text":"I'm going with you!","source_cn":"——我！我也要和你们一起去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x133F129A724F7C42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1110931027:0":{"text":"I have performed divination several times in search of my friend. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> was always in my vision.","source_cn":"为了追寻我失散的朋友，我之前做了好几次寻人占卜。在那些...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x57E0C04EAF358AE1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I have performed divination several times in search of my friend. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> was always in my vision.","female":"I have performed divination several times in search of my friend. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> was always in my vision.","variant_male_record_index":"123836","variant_female_record_index":"123837","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1110931028:1":{"text":"I have to join you in order to find her.","source_cn":"要找到她，我必须和你们一起上路！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D11316036788CC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:45:1110931028":{"text":"I have to join you in order to find her.","source_cn":"要找到她，我必须和你们一起上路！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D11316036788CC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1110931030:0":{"text":"Ready to go?","source_cn":"——你们终于聊完啦？这就要走了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FCEB99C9BC53A50","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:49:1110931030":{"text":"Ready to go?","source_cn":"——你们终于聊完啦？这就要走了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FCEB99C9BC53A50","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1110931031:0":{"text":"I need a minute with that Mauler lady who wronged me and refused to apologize.","source_cn":"找那位诬陷我不道歉的蛮血妹子，有事要问她。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xABCE4535D456AC35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1110931032:0":{"text":"Hmph! If you really need an apology... I'm sorry. All good?","source_cn":"……哼，要道歉的话，我说就是了！\\n“对不起。”可以了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCEF209E1D9DB04A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1110931033:0":{"text":"Not good enough, but I'm very forgiving. Actually, I have a question for you.","source_cn":"马马虎虎啦，我也不是那么小心眼的人。不过，有个问题要问你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06316DF05592B7F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:53:1110931034:0":{"text":"I've searched everywhere in town and exhausted all my resources. But no one knows what the treasure of the Crimson Highlands is. They can't even figure out who started the rumor.","source_cn":"我在镇上打探了一圈，还用上不少秘密渠道。结果，没有一个...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC59DCAFD0C0F97BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:54:1110931035:0":{"text":"As a diviner, prophet, psychic, or whatever you prefer to call yourself, please tell me if the treasure of the Crimson Highlands really exists based on your intuition.","source_cn":"那么，以占卜师、先知、灵媒……不管什么身份，凭你的直觉...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4003A44AFA7F084","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:55:1110931036:1":{"text":"Based on my intuition?","source_cn":"凭借直觉？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49EA26BDA572972F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:56:1110931037:1":{"text":"I don't feel anything... I need a more sophisticated ceremony to answer your question, but I'm unable to focus after what just happened.","source_cn":"……我现在什么也感应不到，得进行更精密的仪式才行。但是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x292BA9E393716B54","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:57:1110931038:1":{"text":"Hmph... I knew it...","source_cn":"哼……果然有蹊跷……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x546808B40A81C845","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:58:1110931039:1":{"text":"I've got what I want. It's time to say goodbye. Best of luck.","source_cn":"我已经拿到想要的消息了，就在这里道别吧。你们还有正事要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAED002C42FEADFB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:49:0:1":{"text":"What are you doing here?","source_cn":"你怎么跟过来了？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x91C8C6BDAF2D9483","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"What are you doing here?","female":"What are you doing here?","variant_male_record_index":"64068","variant_female_record_index":"64069","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:45:0:1":{"text":"Alright then...","source_cn":"那好吧","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x431BF44C68549FB2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Alright then...","female":"Alright then...","variant_male_record_index":"64062","variant_female_record_index":"64063","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:45:1:2":{"text":"An extra pair of hands could help.","source_cn":"也算多一份助力","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6D92C0FA40932600","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"An extra pair of hands could help.","female":"An extra pair of hands could help.","variant_male_record_index":"64064","variant_female_record_index":"64065","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:60:1110931029:0":{"text":"Hmph! You'll definitely find it helpful to have a girl with you who can see into the future!","source_cn":"哼~有一个能窥视命运的好女孩协助，你们高兴还来不及呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6BEF161EB38A65E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:45:2:3":{"text":"Don't be a burden on us!","source_cn":"你可不要拖累我们！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5158FE0C92EA8C44","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Don't be a burden on us!","female":"Don'